    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/c/c9/Jelitta_Beatiful_Poison_Sting_QBULB_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20260202024548\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Jelitta Beatiful Poison Sting QBULB \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/c/c9/Jelitta_Beatiful_Poison_Sting_QBULB_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20260202024548\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"997\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Jelitta Beatiful Poison Sting QBULB .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Jelitta_Beatiful_Poison_Sting_QBULB_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><br />\n<b>美丽毒刺</b>\n</p><p><br />\n\n一位游荡在曾经辉煌灿烂的水下文明废墟中的战士。尽管她外表冷静沉稳、举止优雅飘逸，但她会利用涂有神经毒素的暗器使对手麻痹，以此进行战斗。\n\n</p><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/1/16/Jelitta_Beatiful_Poison_Sting_S_QBULB_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20260202024546\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Jelitta Beatiful Poison Sting S QBULB \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/1/16/Jelitta_Beatiful_Poison_Sting_S_QBULB_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20260202024546\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"1000\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Jelitta Beatiful Poison Sting S QBULB .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Jelitta_Beatiful_Poison_Sting_S_QBULB_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260820165830\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.007 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.007 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 1/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand si